new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1ec92f0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69890.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+The ``diskusage`` beacon can now alert when a mount's usage *drops* below a configured
+percentage, in addition to the existing "usage rose above" alert. Configure it by giving a
+mount a mapping with ``minimum``/``maximum`` keys instead of a bare percentage, e.g.
+``/mnt/nfs: {minimum: 20%, maximum: 90%}``. Existing bare-percentage configuration
+(``mount: 63%``) is unaffected and keeps behaving exactly as before.
